    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-1" id="fn-1" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#010101;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">On page 110, the Company reports Total Utility Plant of $543,166,876 which includes $20,979,003 in Right of Use Assets related to Operating Leases. For the purposes of this page, the Right of Use Assets are excluded</span>
        <span style="color:#262626;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">.</span>
