    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-3" id="fn-3" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="color:#020202;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">On page 110, the company reports a Total Accumulated Provision for Depreciation/Amortization and Depletion of $95,770,450 which includes $2,613,787 in Right of Use Assets related to Operating Leases. For the purposes of this page, the Right of Use Assets are excluded</span>
    </link:footnote>
